{"id":"f40774d4e625146e","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-polynomial.md","title":"Polynomial","display":"df-polynomial — Polynomial","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-polynomial","aliases":["93-df-polynomial"],"display":"df-polynomial — Polynomial","depends_on":["[[93-df-term]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-deterministic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-polynomial"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-polynomial</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial — Polynomial"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"096eaa05407a0ec3\" href=\"?note=096eaa05407a0ec3\" title=\"93-df-deterministic\">93-df-deterministic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> is a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-algebra candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the sourced algebra predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}\">\\(\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}\\)</span> is the sourced term-evaluation map of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"096eaa05407a0ec3\" href=\"?note=096eaa05407a0ec3\" title=\"93-df-deterministic\">93-df-deterministic</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_k=\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(X_k=\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span> is the canonical <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-variable set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ParamVal}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ParamVal}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}\\)</span> are the explicitly indexed parameter valuation and term-evaluation constructors defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pol}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Pol}_n\\)</span> are explicitly type-indexed definitions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\nX_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ParamVal}_{93}(\\bar a,\\bar c;n,m)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_i,\\bar a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle v_{n+j},\\bar c(j)\\rangle:j&lt;m\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}(t,\\bar a,\\bar c;\\mathfrak A,\\tau,n,m)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\tau}_{\n\\operatorname{ParamVal}_{93}(\\bar a,\\bar c;n,m)}(t).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\nX_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ParamVal}_{93}(\\bar a,\\bar c;n,m)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_i,\\bar a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle v_{n+j},\\bar c(j)\\rangle:j&lt;m\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}(t,\\bar a,\\bar c;\\mathfrak A,\\tau,n,m)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\tau}_{\n\\operatorname{ParamVal}_{93}(\\bar a,\\bar c;n,m)}(t).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\nn,m\\in\\omega\\land\\bar a\\in A^n\\land\\bar c\\in A^m\n\\to\\operatorname{ParamVal}_{93}(\\bar a,\\bar c;n,m):X_{n+m}\\to A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\nn,m\\in\\omega\\land\\bar a\\in A^n\\land\\bar c\\in A^m\n\\to\\operatorname{ParamVal}_{93}(\\bar a,\\bar c;n,m):X_{n+m}\\to A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(f,\\mathfrak A,n;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land f:|\\mathfrak A|^n\\to|\\mathfrak A|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists t\\in T_{\\tau}(X_{n+m})\\;\n\\exists\\bar c\\in|\\mathfrak A|^m\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\;\n\\bigl(f(\\bar a)=\n\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}(t,\\bar a,\\bar c;\\mathfrak A,\\tau,n,m)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(f,\\mathfrak A,n;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land f:|\\mathfrak A|^n\\to|\\mathfrak A|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists t\\in T_{\\tau}(X_{n+m})\\;\n\\exists\\bar c\\in|\\mathfrak A|^m\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\;\n\\bigl(f(\\bar a)=\n\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}(t,\\bar a,\\bar c;\\mathfrak A,\\tau,n,m)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pol}_n(\\mathfrak A;\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in(|\\mathfrak A|^n\\to|\\mathfrak A|):\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(f,\\mathfrak A,n;\\tau)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pol}_n(\\mathfrak A;\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in(|\\mathfrak A|^n\\to|\\mathfrak A|):\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(f,\\mathfrak A,n;\\tau)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two disjoint indexed variable blocks and their valuation graph are explicit. The tuple <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar c\">\\(\\bar c\\)</span> supplies parameters from the carrier; when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span>, the polynomial operation is an ordinary term operation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-deterministic","status":"resolved","id":"096eaa05407a0ec3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-deterministic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-deterministic","status":"resolved","id":"096eaa05407a0ec3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}$ is the sourced term-evaluation map of [[93-df-deterministic]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}","display":false},{"tex":"X_k=\\{v_i:i<k\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ParamVal}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pol}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\nX_k&\\coloneqq\\{v_i:i<k\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ParamVal}_{93}(\\bar a,\\bar c;n,m)&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_i,\\bar a(i)\\rangle:i<n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle v_{n+j},\\bar c(j)\\rangle:j<m\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}(t,\\bar a,\\bar c;\\mathfrak A,\\tau,n,m)\n&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\tau}_{\n\\operatorname{ParamVal}_{93}(\\bar a,\\bar c;n,m)}(t).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\nn,m\\in\\omega\\land\\bar a\\in A^n\\land\\bar c\\in A^m\n\\to\\operatorname{ParamVal}_{93}(\\bar a,\\bar c;n,m):X_{n+m}\\to A","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(f,\\mathfrak A,n;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land f:|\\mathfrak A|^n\\to|\\mathfrak A|\\\\\n&\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists t\\in T_{\\tau}(X_{n+m})\\;\n\\exists\\bar c\\in|\\mathfrak A|^m\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\;\n\\bigl(f(\\bar a)=\n\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}(t,\\bar a,\\bar c;\\mathfrak A,\\tau,n,m)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pol}_n(\\mathfrak A;\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in(|\\mathfrak A|^n\\to|\\mathfrak A|):\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(f,\\mathfrak A,n;\\tau)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bar c","display":false},{"tex":"m=0","display":false}],"bytes":2289,"backlinks":[{"id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]]. For $m,n\\in\\omega$, $\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(p,\\mathbf A,m+n;\\tau)$ says that $p$ is an $(m+n)$-ary polynomial operation as in [[93-df-polynomial]]."},{"id":"7c60f8381488af43","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]], and the type-indexed predicate $\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}$ is from [[93-df-polynomial]]."},{"id":"53f0f7e6a055d365","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pol}_n(\\mathbf2;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})$ is its set of $n$-ary polynomial operations as in [[93-df-polynomial]]."},{"id":"ad928579e25d9ea2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$T_{\\tau}(X_{n+m})$ is the canonical-variable term set and $\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}$ is the fully indexed evaluation of [[93-df-polynomial]]."},{"id":"004b454b6cf02e89","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}$ are the evaluation constructor and type-indexed predicate of [[93-df-polynomial]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-polynomial]]"}],"outgoing":["ca7404158049be33","6730349967b8ffce","096eaa05407a0ec3"]}